Approve a change the assistant is waiting on. It runs exactly the call shown

Usage: mxr assistant approve [OPTIONS] <CONVERSATION> <CALL_ID>

Arguments:
  <CONVERSATION>
  <CALL_ID>

Options:
      --no-wait
      --format <FORMAT>  [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help             Print help
